OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in court after police
OL,4,Aofficer shot in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has appeared in court in
OL,7,Fconnection with the shooting of a
OL,8,Fpolice officer in Nottingham city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FAn officer was shot in the foot after
OL,12,Fbeing called to Angel Row at about
OL,13,F04:50 BST on Sunday.
OL,15,FAisha Zaman has been charged with
OL,16,Fpossession of a prohibited firearm -
OL,17,Fwhich magistrates heard was an adapted
OL,18,Fshotgun - and possession of that
OL,19,Ffirearm with intent to commit an
OL,20,Findictable offence.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
