OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in court after police
OL,4,Aofficer shot in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 27-year-old, of Collison Street in
OL,7,FHyson Green, appeared at Nottingham
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court on Friday, and is
OL,9,Fnext set to appear at Nottingham Crown
OL,10,FCourt on 20 November.
